      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Un día, la hija caminaba sola cuando llegó un visitante.",
          "en": "One day, the daughter was walking alone when a visitor came."
        },
        {
          "es": "En una versión, era el Viento del Oeste, que sopló suave a su alrededor.",
          "en": "In one telling, it was the West Wind, who blew softly all around her."
        },
        {
          "es": "En otra, era un joven misterioso. Dejó dos flechas a su lado: una con punta de pedernal, y otra sin punta.",
          "en": "In another, a mysterious young man came. He laid two arrows beside her: one tipped with sharp flint, and one without."
        },
        {
          "es": "Poco después, ella supo que iba a tener gemelos.",
          "en": "Soon after, she knew she was going to have twins."
        }
      ],
