      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Los gemelos discutían incluso antes de nacer.",
          "en": "Even before they were born, the twins argued."
        },
        {
          "es": "Uno decía: «Voy a nacer por el camino de siempre, como todos».",
          "en": "One said, \"I will be born the usual way, like everyone else.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "El otro decía: «Veo luz por allá. ¡Yo voy a salir por ese lado!»",
          "en": "The other said, \"I can see light over there. I will go out that way!\""
        },
        {
          "es": "La hija de la Mujer del Cielo sentía la pelea, y tenía miedo.",
          "en": "Sky Woman's daughter could feel them fighting, and she was afraid."
        }
      ],
