          1.05
        ]
      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "El primer gemelo nació de la manera normal. Era tranquilo y bueno. Lo llamarían Brote.",
          "en": "The first twin was born the normal way. He was calm and kind. He would be called Sapling."
        },
        {
          "es": "El segundo no quiso esperar. Se abrió paso por el costado de su madre.",
          "en": "The second twin would not wait. He pushed his way out through his mother's side."
        },
        {
          "es": "Su cuerpo era duro y filoso, como la piedra. Lo llamarían Pedernal.",
          "en": "His body was hard and sharp, like stone. He would be called Flint."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y su madre, la hija de la Mujer del Cielo, no sobrevivió.",
          "en": "And their mother, Sky Woman's daughter, did not survive."
        }
      ],
